    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Lawrence Meeks' first childe, Avery was an orphan he plucked from the streets to test whether @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.UhaIbwzsC1O2x9vr]{Nosferatu} spies could be trained rather than merely recruited. She exceeded his hopes, taking to espionage with genuine relish and specializing in mortal affairs while her &ldquo;brothers&rdquo; Roger and Martin focused on Kindred intrigue. She now sits, somewhat reluctantly, on the Prince's Council, one of the few members not entirely devoted to undermining Marcel &mdash; though she does not entirely trust him either. She also styles herself an unofficial protector of the city's weaker refugees and runaways, both mortal and Kindred.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Not antisocial by nature, but you avoid company unless you must keep it, at which point you can be quite charming.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 3, Celerity 2, Dominate 2, Fortitude 1, Obfuscate 3, Potence 4, Presence 3, Protean 2.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Lawrence Meeks. Haven: A small apartment near the docks. Secrets rating: B+.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
